.TH IO_CANCEL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
io_cancel \- attempts to cancel an outstanding kernel aio request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/aio.h>
.B int io_cancel(aio_context_t context, struct iocb* request, struct io_event* result);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Attempts to cancel an outstanding kernel AIO request. This is the Linux kernel AIO ABI, not POSIX aio.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR io_cancel (2)
